      <ul class="styled-list"><li class="styled-list-item styled-list-item--arrow"><a href="/en/living-in-the-netherlands-with-a-residence-permit/living-in-the-netherlands" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="c3283306-5e4e-404b-b97e-6e2039525527" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Living in the Netherlands">Living in the Netherlands</a></li><li class="styled-list-item styled-list-item--arrow"><a href="/en/replace-extend-renew-and-change/change/staying-in-the-netherlands-if-your-situation-with-the-eu-citizen-has-changed" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="f097461b-ac60-4c23-88a6-5c3e7a5c1188" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Staying in the Netherlands if your situation with the EU citizen has changed">Staying in the Netherlands if the situation with the Union citizen changed</a></li><li class="styled-list-item styled-list-item--arrow"><a href="/en/living-in-the-netherlands-with-a-residence-permit/travelling-with-a-residence-permit-and-a-return-visa" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="8db8263d-5a3a-4cc0-ae0b-13b20448afa4" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Travelling with a residence permit and a return visa">Travelling with a residence permit and return visa</a></li><li class="styled-list-item styled-list-item--arrow"><a href="/en/residence-permits/eu-eea-or-swiss-citizens/permanent-residency-for-union-citizens-and-their-family" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="525c26e0-64e1-464a-a198-953f80431f7b" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Permanent residency for Union citizens and their family">Permanent residence permit for Union citizens and their family</a></li></ul><h3>Rules and regulations</h3><ul class="styled-list"><li class="styled-list-item styled-list-item--arrow"><a href="https://wetten.overheid.nl/jci1.3:c:BWBR0011825&amp;hoofdstuk=8&amp;afdeling=2&amp;paragraaf=2&amp;artikel=8.7&amp;z=2023-01-01&amp;g=2023-01-01" title="Article 8.7 Vreemdelingenbesluit 2000">Article 8.7 Aliens Decree (Vreemdelingenbesluit 2000)</a></li><li class="styled-list-item styled-list-item--arrow"><a href="https://wetten.overheid.nl/BWBR0011825/2020-08-01/#Hoofdstuk8_Afdeling2_Paragraaf2_Artikel8.9" title="Article 8.9 Vreemdelingenbesluit 2000">Article 8.9 Aliens Decree (Vreemdelingenbesluit 2000)</a></li><li class="styled-list-item styled-list-item--arrow"><a href="https://wetten.overheid.nl/jci1.3:c:BWBR0011825&amp;hoofdstuk=8&amp;afdeling=2&amp;paragraaf=2&amp;artikel=8.13&amp;z=2023-01-01&amp;g=2023-01-01" title="Article 8.13 Vreemdelingenbesluit 2000">Article 8.13 Aliens Decree (Vreemdelingenbesluit 2000)</a></li><li class="styled-list-item styled-list-item--arrow"><a href="https://wetten.overheid.nl/BWBR0012289/2020-10-01#Circulaire.divisieB10_Circulaire.divisie2" title="Aliens Act Implementation Guidelines">B10/2 Aliens Act Implementation Guidelines (Vreemdelingencirculaire 2000)​</a></li></ul>
